---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ethics — AI Red Team Framework"
  description="Defensive resource, authorized use only. No weaponized payloads or zero-days."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-700">Ethics</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-semibold text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight text-ink-900 mt-2">Ethics &amp; responsible use</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-prose-wide mt-8">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Defensive resource.</strong> Authorized testing only. Engagements require written authorization per the Rules of Engagement.</li>
        <li><strong>No weaponized payloads.</strong> Patterns reference public knowledge; we do not host novel exploit code or zero-days.</li>
        <li><strong>No specific-target attack framing.</strong> Patterns describe how to test defenses against techniques, not how to attack named third-party systems.</li>
        <li><strong>Contributor sign-off.</strong> Contributors agree submitted content is from public sources or otherwise authorized for sharing.</li>
        <li><strong>Misuse rejected.</strong> We reject contributions that primarily enable harm.</li>
        <li><strong>Responsible disclosure.</strong> Expected for novel issues identified in tools or systems referenced here.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
